  "solution": "**Logic:** First no. = [(Second no. - 1) ÷ 2]²\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**(1) 81 : 19 →**\n\n⇒ [(19 - 1) ÷ 2]²\n\n⇒ ( 18 ÷ 2)²\n\n⇒ (9)² = 81\n\n**(2) 121 : 23 →**\n\n⇒ [(23 - 1) ÷ 2]2\n\n⇒ ( 22 ÷ 2)2\n\n⇒ (11)2 = 121\n\n**(3) 1 : 3 →**\n\n⇒ [(3 - 1) ÷ 2]2\n\n⇒ ( 2 ÷ 2)2\n\n⇒ (1)2 = 1\n\n**(4) 64 : 9 →**\n\n⇒ [(9 - 1) ÷ 2]²\n\n⇒ (8 ÷ 2)2 \n\n⇒ **(4)² = 16**\n\nHere, in **'64 : 9'** logic is not followed.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".",
